---
description: classDef applied by shorthand and by cssClass, and an inline style
---
classDiagram
  class Hot:::warm {
    +heat()
  }
  class Cold
  class Neutral
  classDef warm fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  classDef cool fill:#9cf,stroke:#036,color:#000
  cssClass "Cold" cool
  style Neutral fill:#eee,stroke:#999,stroke-width:3px
  Hot --> Cold
  Cold --> Neutral
